%description:
TR 38.901 Table 7.2-4 gives the dense sub-scenarios of the Indoor Factory (InF-DL, InF-DH) a clutter
density of 40 % or more, and the sparse ones (InF-SL, InF-SH) one below 40 %. A cell that names a
dense sub-scenario with the clutter of a sparse hall is an error at initialization: its LOS
probability would be the sparse hall's under the dense hall's path loss.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.gnb*.scenario = "INDOOR_FACTORY_DL"
*.gnb*.clutterDensity = 0.2
*.gnb.cellularNic.antenna.mobility.offsetZ = 1.5m

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
clutterDensity = 0.2: the scenario INDOOR_FACTORY_DL has dense clutter, a density of 0.4 or more (TR 38.901 Table 7.2-4)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
